.TH VMBACKUPD 8 "August 2026" "vmbackupd 0.1.1" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
vmbackupd \- KVM/libvirt virtual machine backup management daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vmbackupd
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B vmbackupd
is a persistent local daemon for KVM/libvirt virtual machine backup,
replication, retention, and restore orchestration.

The daemon exposes a local control API and integrates with the vmbackupd
Cockpit frontend.

Configuration is stored in
.IR /etc/vmbackupd/vmbackupd.toml .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR vmbackupctl (1),
.BR virsh (1),
.BR systemctl (1)
